OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to destroy electric bikes
OL,4,Aand scooters seized in crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 140 electric bikes and
OL,7,Fscooters will be destroyed after they
OL,8,Fwere seized by Police Scotland during a
OL,9,Fnationwide crackdown.
OL,11,FOfficers confiscated 99 e-bikes and 43
OL,12,Fe-scooters during Operation Overlap,
OL,13,Fwhich ran between 19 and 25 October.
OL,15,FThe largest number were confiscated in
OL,16,FGlasgow bringing the total for the year
OL,17,F- up to 16 October - to 1,000.
OL,19,FSupt Andy Barclay said illegally
OL,20,Fmodified e-bikes were dangerous and not
OL,21,Fsuitable for public roads.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
